{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When colossal alien titans run rampant until getting domed by a railgun, the world finds itself in need of a true hero. That\u2019s you: a Kaiju Cleaner who won\u2019t be perturbed by petty concerns like \u201cworkplace injury\u201d or \u201clife expectancy\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/fb69544eb87e91ad0072d59d3e3e685e.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/91c0e43eabeca56f995d1f9d1ac41f39.poster.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/91c0e43eabeca56f995d1f9d1ac41f39.webm?t=1773423734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After another bastard Kaiju attacks another crowded city, you must use your tools to clean up vast piles of dead monster until the zone is safe for reconstruction. The Kaiju may be dead, but its corpse is leaking radiation, seeping acidic fluids, concealing explosive organs, and generally making the area inhospitable to any other form of life. You\u2019ll probably die as you go about your work, but that\u2019s fine; send another clone, mop up your corpse, and carry on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/6fa5d2009502023d333e7cd9cc4ee449.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/396c52dabc56075d745193c5a7b2f9c8.poster.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/396c52dabc56075d745193c5a7b2f9c8.webm?t=1773423734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When dealing with Kaiju this big, the detritus warrants calling in a team. Up to 4 cleaners can tackle the monstrous mess left behind via online co-op.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/00ad157b8f99dca4ed9c51fea1c815f7.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/867a5a264e89852dfb1c2fd584baf52f.poster.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/867a5a264e89852dfb1c2fd584baf52f.webm?t=1773423734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy therapeutic tasks with your own methodology and a selection of helpful tools. Work at your own pace; that giant corpse isn\u2019t going anywhere. Extract and launch Kaiju innards with a meat-wrenching claw, slice them into manageable chunks, slurp up its various jellies, and power-wash detritus until the hazard zone is sparkling clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/698ecf3602934b92bb3aee5e254aca9d.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/5487701fcdf1b8ffe6cf795e16782730.poster.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/5487701fcdf1b8ffe6cf795e16782730.webm?t=1773423734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn KaijuCorp from a scrappy band of outcasts and delinquents into Earth\u2019s best Kaiju Cleanup firm either solo or as part of a team of up to four reprobates. Complete missions to upgrade your equipment and customize your base, van, and outfit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/19c76283ca276cfe76ce4b2cf67710df.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/aa4542d477356c42c03213bc2a77b98e.poster.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/aa4542d477356c42c03213bc2a77b98e.webm?t=1773423734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments the Kaiju have rudely died in and figure out what they have against skyscrapers anyway. Pick apart audio logs, chat with your crew, leaf through an evolving codex of Kaiju research, and enjoy rigorous fact-checking with InfoBlast, a legally-recognised news programme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/510a5fd8f741f7689121f63c70296f5e.poster.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/510a5fd8f741f7689121f63c70296f5e.webm?t=1773423734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>We think you'll love Kaiju Cleanup if you enjoy...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crime Scene Cleaner, Satisfactory, House Flipper 2, Hardspace: Shipbreaker, PowerWash Simulator 2, Leathal Company, Peak, Supermarket Simulator, Content Warning, KAIJU NO.8 THE GAME</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729700?t=1773423734","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729700?t=1773423734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/0fd05ae7d056a3df51bee33b8e905662c76377f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773423734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/0fd05ae7d056a3df51bee33b8e905662c76377f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773423734","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Clearing out monster carcasses inevitably entails the depiction of: blood, flesh, bones, organs and other types of internal matter. It's also dangerous work, involving: human corpses, hazardous materials, and numerous, often gruesome, ways for the player to meet their end.\r\n\r\nAll scenes of gore are cartoonish in presentation and in-world discussion of death, dismemberment or injury is intentionally comic. Expect crude language, dead clones, and many, many dead Kaiju."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/d194ab8cea117333f5f1c691ffada88e.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When colossal alien titans run rampant until getting domed by a railgun, the world finds itself in need of a true hero. That\u2019s you: a Kaiju Cleaner who won\u2019t be perturbed by petty concerns like \u201cworkplace injury\u201d or \u201clife expectancy\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/fb69544eb87e91ad0072d59d3e3e685e.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/91c0e43eabeca56f995d1f9d1ac41f39.poster.avif?t=1773423734\" width=780 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/91c0e43eabeca56f995d1f9d1ac41f39.webm?t=1773423734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After another bastard Kaiju attacks another crowded city, you must use your tools to clean up vast piles of dead monster until the zone is safe for reconstruction. The Kaiju may be dead, but its corpse is leaking radiation, seeping acidic fluids, concealing explosiv